      "message": "[warning] Line 1852: 🟡 `selectionFormat()` mutates editor state by clearing `insertionFont_` whenever it is called for any range other than the exact pending caret position. Because this method is also a read API for UI refresh, benign reads can cancel the pending “apply to next typed text” font choice. Keep `selectionFormat()` side-effect free and clear `insertionFont_` only on explicit cursor/selection state transitions.",
